<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8">
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
        <title>404 | DevSpot</title>
        <style>
            :root {
                color-scheme: light;
            }

            * {
                box-sizing: border-box;
            }

            body {
                margin: 0;
                min-height: 100vh;
                font-family: "Nunito Sans", "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
                background:
                    radial-gradient(circle at 12% 10%, rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.22), transparent 46%),
                    radial-gradient(circle at 88% 18%, rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.18), transparent 42%),
                    linear-gradient(180deg, #f7faff 0%, #eef4ff 100%);
                color: #1f3b6b;
                display: grid;
                place-items: center;
                padding: 24px;
            }

            .card {
                width: min(720px, 100%);
                border: 1px solid #d6e4ff;
                border-radius: 28px;
                background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
                backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
                box-shadow: 0 24px 52px rgba(37, 87, 214, 0.14);
                padding: 34px;
            }

            .badge {
                display: inline-block;
                margin-bottom: 14px;
                border: 1px solid #93c5fd;
                color: #1e40af;
                background: #dbeafe;
                border-radius: 999px;
                padding: 6px 12px;
                font-size: 12px;
                font-weight: 700;
                letter-spacing: .08em;
                text-transform: uppercase;
            }

            h1 {
                margin: 0;
                font-size: clamp(2rem, 3vw, 2.7rem);
                line-height: 1.1;
                color: #16325c;
            }

            p {
                margin: 14px 0 0;
                color: #4f6b99;
                line-height: 1.6;
            }

            .actions {
                margin-top: 24px;
                display: flex;
                flex-wrap: wrap;
                gap: 10px;
            }

            a {
                text-decoration: none;
                border-radius: 999px;
                padding: 11px 16px;
                font-weight: 700;
                font-size: 14px;
                transition: transform .2s ease, opacity .2s ease;
            }

            a:hover {
                transform: translateY(-1px);
                opacity: .95;
            }

            .primary {
                background: #2557d6;
                color: #ffffff;
            }

            .ghost {
                border: 1px solid #c3d7ff;
                background: #edf3ff;
                color: #244a86;
            }
        </style>
    </head>
    <body>
        <main class="card">
            <span class="badge">Erreur 404</span>
            <h1>Cette page n’existe pas.</h1>
            <p>L’URL demandée est introuvable ou le profil recherché n’existe plus.</p>
            <div class="actions">
                <a class="primary" href="{{ path('app_home') }}">Retour à l’accueil</a>
                <a class="ghost" href="javascript:history.back()">Page précédente</a>
            </div>
        </main>
    </body>
</html>
